  \caption{The electoral evolution of parties in municipal races 1979--2025. Color-coded circles report a given party's vote percentage in a municipal election (slightly x-jittered for visibility). Curves show the median vote share won by each party across municipalities over time (the trend is smoothed for clarity).}\label{F:vpcts}
  % \alt={Scatterplot of party vote shares across municipalities over time: for each party, a summary curve traces its median vote share across municipalities, while the underlying observations show the distribution of vote shares in all municipal races.}
